body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:e476174520e8261b7e031f5bfbe056334ca2e7446dcee909355c14f1f159bd71","file":"preprints/Finite-triangular-approximation-of-radial-sweeps-September-27-2026/build/introduction.tex","line":95,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"08e5ade440b63a0a326379c7417e11cd6f8256a531f3a3f2858c4fae66be242f","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Finite-triangular-approximation-of-radial-sweeps-September-27-2026/build/introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:e476174520e8261b7e031f5bfbe056334ca2e7446dcee909355c14f1f159bd71","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Finite-triangular-approximation-of-radial-sweeps-September-27-2026/build/introduction.tex#L95"},"statement_kind":"corollary","text":"\\label{cor:tetrahedron}\nEvery regular tetrahedron $K\\subset\\R^3$ of positive edge length has\na finite cylinder cover $B_i+\\R u_i$, with unit axes $u_i$ and\nnondegenerate compact triangular bases $B_i\\subset u_i^\\perp$, such that\n\\[\n \\sum_i\\area(B_i)<\\frac{A_{\\min}(K)}2,\n \\qquad\n \\sum_i\\frac{\\area(B_i)}{\\area(\\pi_{u_i^\\perp}K)}<\\frac12.\n\\]"}
